    "label_names": [],
    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HFCS7NCSG6KXMCQT1FSPQBTC\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to prevent a specific recipient from receiving a flow by cancelling the email for just that one person.</p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>It's important to note that cancelling an email for a single recipient will remove them from the flow entirely, and they will not progress to other steps or receive any of the remaining messages in the flow.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HFCTHAFA1MKVK5KX7TFEJ0K0\">Cancel a flow email for a single recipient</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">You can cancel recipients who are in either the </span><em>Waiting </em><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">or </span><em>Needs Review</em><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"> statuses from receiving the next email and the rest of a flow entirely.</span></p>\n<p>To do this:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open your flow.</li>\n<li>Click on the specific email message that you would like to cancel a subscriber from receiving.</li>\n<li>In the right details sidebar, click<strong> View details </strong>from within the <em>Performance</em> section.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717849626267\" alt=\"In the peformance section in the details sidebar, with View details button highlighted\" width=\"350\" height=\"169\">\n</li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Recipient activity</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>Find the recipient you would like to cancel the email for. Note that these can only be recipients in the <em>Waiting </em>or <em>Needs Review</em> lists.</li>\n<li>Hover over their name to expose additions options and click on <strong>Cancel Send</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717809981467\" alt=\"Hovering over a recipient email with Cancel Send button highlighted\">\n</li>\n<li>Confirm you want to cancel the recipient from that email and the rest of the flow by clicking <strong>Cancel Send</strong>. Otherwise, choose <strong>Nevermind</strong> to abandon the process.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HFCS7NCSY6A7W11QP99H49S8\">Additional resources</h2>\n<p>Learn more about managing flow emails:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115003872191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to add an email to a flow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360046797191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to resend emails in Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/6960371049115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to A/B test a flow email</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
